            <button type="button" class="melodies-btn melodies-btn-secondary" id="playEarManualRevealBtn" disabled="">Reveal answer</button>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="melodies-result" id="playEarResult"><strong>Opening guitar melody</strong><span>My Girl · C major</span><div class="melodies-answer"><b>Correct intervals</b><div><span>1</span><i aria-hidden="true">–</i><span>2</span><i aria-hidden="true">–</i><span>3</span><i aria-hidden="true">–</i><span>5</span><i aria-hidden="true">–</i><span>6</span><i aria-hidden="true">–</i><span>1</span></div></div><small>Relative interval sequence matched; key and rhythm were not scored.</small></div>
