          <span id="playEarHint">Replay it as many times as you need.</span>
        </div>

        <label class="play-ear-pause-setting">
          <input type="checkbox" id="playEarPauseWhileGuessing" checked="">
          <span><strong>Pause video while guessing</strong><small>Turn this off when using an audio interface or headphones.</small></span>
        </label>

        <fieldset class="melodies-method">
          <legend>How do you want to guess?</legend>
          <button type="button" class="melodies-method-btn" id="playEarMicMethodBtn" aria-pressed="false">
            <strong>Play it</strong><span>Use selected audio input</span>
          </button>
          <button type="button" class="melodies-method-btn active" id="playEarManualMethodBtn" aria-pressed="true">
            <strong>Enter intervals</strong><span>No listening required</span>
          </button>
        </fieldset>

        <div class="melodies-progress" aria-label="Section progress">
          <div class="melodies-progress-track"><span id="playEarProgressBar" style="width: 0%;"></span></div>
          <span id="playEarProgressText">0 of 6 entered</span>
        </div>

        <div id="playEarMicrophonePanel" hidden="">
          <div class="melodies-detected" aria-live="polite">
            <span class="melodies-detected-label">Heard</span>
            <strong id="playEarDetectedNote">—</strong>
            <div class="play-ear-detected-details">
              <span id="playEarDetectedInterval">Waiting for your guitar</span>
              <div class="play-ear-heard-actions">
                <button type="button" class="melodies-link-btn" id="playEarResetNotesBtn" disabled="">Reset notes</button>
                <button type="button" class="melodies-link-btn" id="playEarPlayHeardBtn" disabled="">Play heard notes</button>
              </div>
              <label class="play-ear-auto-clear-setting">
                <input type="checkbox" id="playEarAutoClearNotes" checked="">
                <small>Auto-clear after 5 seconds</small>
              </label>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="melodies-actions">
            <button type="button" class="melodies-btn melodies-btn-primary" id="playEarGuessBtn">Start playing</button>
            <button type="button" class="melodies-btn melodies-btn-secondary" id="playEarRevealBtn">Reveal answer</button>
          </div>
          <p class="play-ear-detection-hint">For reliable recognition, play clean single notes and let each one sound briefly.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="melodies-manual" id="playEarManualPanel">
          <label class="melodies-manual-label" for="playEarIntervalInput">Treat the first heard note as 1, or use degrees from the song key.</label>
          <div class="melodies-interval-entry" id="playEarIntervalEntry">
            <div class="melodies-interval-boxes" id="playEarIntervalBoxes"><span class="melodies-interval-slot"><span class="melodies-interval-box"></span><button type="button" class="melodies-accidental-btn" data-play-ear-accidental="0" aria-label="Interval 1 is natural; change accidental" disabled=""></button></span><span class="melodies-interval-slot"><span class="melodies-interval-box"></span><button type="button" class="melodies-accidental-btn" data-play-ear-accidental="1" aria-label="Interval 2 is natural; change accidental" disabled=""></button></span><span class="melodies-interval-slot"><span class="melodies-interval-box"></span><button type="button" class="melodies-accidental-btn" data-play-ear-accidental="2" aria-label="Interval 3 is natural; change accidental" disabled=""></button></span><span class="melodies-interval-slot"><span class="melodies-interval-box"></span><button type="button" class="melodies-accidental-btn" data-play-ear-accidental="3" aria-label="Interval 4 is natural; change accidental" disabled=""></button></span><span class="melodies-interval-slot"><span class="melodies-interval-box"></span><button type="button" class="melodies-accidental-btn" data-play-ear-accidental="4" aria-label="Interval 5 is natural; change accidental" disabled=""></button></span><span class="melodies-interval-slot"><span class="melodies-interval-box"></span><button type="button" class="melodies-accidental-btn" data-play-ear-accidental="5" aria-label="Interval 6 is natural; change accidental" disabled=""></button></span></div>
            <input id="playEarIntervalInput" class="melodies-interval-input" type="text" inputmode="numeric" pattern="[1-7]*" autocomplete="off" aria-label="Section scale degrees" maxlength="6" disabled="">
          </div>
          <div class="melodies-actions">
            <button type="button" class="melodies-btn melodies-btn-primary melodies-check-btn" id="playEarCheckBtn" disabled="">Check intervals</button>
            <button type="button" class="melodies-btn melodies-btn-secondary" id="playEarManualRevealBtn">Reveal answer</button>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="melodies-result" id="playEarResult" hidden=""><strong>Opening guitar melody</strong><span>My Girl · C major</span><div class="melodies-answer"><b>Correct intervals</b><div><span>1</span><i aria-hidden="true">–</i><span>2</span><i aria-hidden="true">–</i><span>3</span><i aria-hidden="true">–</i><span>5</span><i aria-hidden="true">–</i><span>6</span><i aria-hidden="true">–</i><span>1</span></div></div><small>Listen again and notice the interval shape.</small></div>
      </section>
    </div>

    <aside class="audio-input-panel">
    <div class="audio-input-notice">
      <strong>Audio interface recommended</strong>
      <span>To play along while the video loops, connect your guitar through an audio interface. Otherwise, pause the video while guessing.</span>
    </div>
    <label class="audio-input-field" for="playEarAudioInput">
      <span>Audio input</span>
      <select id="playEarAudioInput" data-audio-input-select="" disabled="">
        <option value="">Allow audio access first</option>
      </select>
    </label>
    <small data-audio-input-help="">Allow audio access once to see device names.</small>
  </aside>
    <p class="melodies-mic-note">Only the selected audio input is analyzed. YouTube audio is never transcribed.</p>
  </section>"
`;

